            "review_text": "Inlovewiththeworld\n3979 contributions\n0\nGood service. Nice atmosphere but wasn't blown away by a best seller ice-cream.\nJan 2023 • Solo\nThis is always busy.  They have a few branches around the city.  It looks like a pretty afternoon tea place or for ladies that lunch!  They offer a big range of savoury food, desserts, drinks and more.  Go during the week when they are quieter.  Located in Saigon Centre mall.  I was lucky to get a seat on a busy Saturday afternoon.  Possibly the last table.  Clean.  Nice atmosphere.  Seats are close together and the branch is open in the mall.  Good to people watch but not always to relax.  I went with one of the best sellers which was the coconut ice-cream with jackfruit.  Portion is perfect for one person.  I was solo dining.  If with others, maybe try a few different desserts and share.  Well presented.  Very 'pretty'.  It was nice but did not take my breath away.  I enjoyed it, I tried it and I ate it.  I have tasted better.  Service was very good despite how busy they were.  Staff were pleasant and spoke basic English.  Go, worth a visit.  I wouldn't go regularly but glad I tried it. Possibly would go back to try something else but not in a hurry.\nRead more\nWritten January 15, 2023",
