            "review_text": "soda4077\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam83 contributions\n0\nThey charge for wet wipes!\nJul 2019 • Family\nI was quiet find of Runam style and decor, till one day I notice 5000 vnd charge for napkins aja wet wipes they give you on the table. The first time I visited the cafe in vincom center (which is not even listed on their website! ) I was served cashew which I hadn't ordered and the next time I realized that I have been charged for wipes! Doesn't every restaurant provide tissues with a meal? And it is not about how much they charge, but the fact that they charge. Runam severs biscuits on a paper dolly, the last thing you expect them is to charge for tissues- simply distasteful, ridiculous, and has to one of it's kind!.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 22, 2019",
